01:27:12,400 --> 01:27:14,320
When it isn't your fault,

3028
01:27:14,320 --> 01:27:15,800
I think you need to

3029
01:27:16,360 --> 01:27:18,480
stand up and speak up for yourself,

3030
01:27:18,480 --> 01:27:19,440
and take the initiative

3031
01:27:19,440 --> 01:27:21,040
to ask others for help.

3032
01:27:21,480 --> 01:27:22,520
When you run into trouble

3033
01:27:22,520 --> 01:27:23,400
or hit a low point in life,

3034
01:27:23,400 --> 01:27:24,480
don't panic.

3035
01:27:24,480 --> 01:27:25,960
Like that song says,

3036
01:27:25,960 --> 01:27:28,720
life is like waves at sea.

3037
01:27:28,720 --> 01:27:30,120
Sometimes you're up,
sometimes you're down.

3038
01:27:30,120 --> 01:27:30,760
Don't let yourself

3039
01:27:30,760 --> 01:27:32,600
get knocked down so easily.

3040
01:27:32,600 --> 01:27:34,520
Things will get better.

3041
01:27:34,520 --> 01:27:35,480
So when

3042
01:27:35,480 --> 01:27:37,840
things don't go your way,

3043
01:27:37,840 --> 01:27:39,720
build up your resilience.

3044
01:27:39,720 --> 01:27:40,280
Then

3045
01:27:41,040 --> 01:27:43,040
keep working hard

3046
01:27:43,040 --> 01:27:43,960
at what matters to you,

3047
01:27:43,960 --> 01:27:45,360
and keep loving life.

3048
01:27:45,360 --> 01:27:46,520
I believe you'll soon

3049
01:27:46,520 --> 01:27:47,800
make it through that low point.

3050
01:27:49,440 --> 01:27:52,360
Sometimes you can't see a way out,

3051
01:27:52,360 --> 01:27:55,440
but one is always there.

3052
01:27:56,720 --> 01:27:57,760
The sun always comes after the rain.

3053
01:27:59,440 --> 01:28:00,320
Believe in yourself.

3054
01:28:00,320 --> 01:28:01,600
You'll get through it.

3055
01:28:01,600 --> 01:28:03,720
You can also talk to someone.

3056
01:28:03,720 --> 01:28:05,120
You don't have to bottle it all up.

3057
01:28:05,120 --> 01:28:07,840
Someone might ride in
on a rainbow cloud to save me.

3058
01:28:07,840 --> 01:28:09,360
Personally,

3059
01:28:09,360 --> 01:28:11,640
in my own life,

3060
01:28:11,640 --> 01:28:12,360
when I face setbacks

3061
01:28:12,360 --> 01:28:14,240
or something makes me uncomfortable,

3062
01:28:14,240 --> 01:28:15,760
I'll choose something

3063
01:28:16,280 --> 01:28:18,760
that can take my mind off it.

3064
01:28:18,760 --> 01:28:19,640
For example,

3065
01:28:19,640 --> 01:28:21,360
I might find a new interest,

3066
01:28:21,840 --> 01:28:22,600
or find

3067
01:28:22,600 --> 01:28:23,640
something else

3068
01:28:23,640 --> 01:28:25,440
I can put my energy into.

3069
01:28:25,840 --> 01:28:27,360
That helps shift my focus,

3070
01:28:27,360 --> 01:28:29,520
instead of letting trouble

3071
01:28:29,520 --> 01:28:31,280
pull me deeper into it

3072
01:28:31,280 --> 01:28:33,320
and make my emotions spiral.

3073
01:28:33,720 --> 01:28:34,640
Just give it time.

3074
01:28:34,640 --> 01:28:35,760
As you grow,

3075
01:28:35,760 --> 01:28:36,960
you'll become stronger.

3076
01:28:37,160 --> 01:28:38,680
Then the problems you once faced

3077
01:28:38,680 --> 01:28:40,600
won't affect you

3078
01:28:40,600 --> 01:28:42,040
nearly as much.

3079
01:28:44,640 --> 01:28:46,280
(Wu Zhihong, Renowned psychologist)
I often say this.

3080
01:28:46,520 --> 01:28:47,860
(Seeing Psychology, Dedao columnist)
We can lose on the outside,

3081
01:28:47,860 --> 01:28:48,460
(Author of Why Family Hurts)

3082
01:28:48,460 --> 01:28:49,160
(And over 10 psychology books,
including Deep Relationships)

3083
01:28:49,160 --> 01:28:50,320
but in our inner game,

3084
01:28:50,320 --> 01:28:51,760
we never have to lose.

3085
01:28:52,000 --> 01:28:52,560
What that means is,

3086
01:28:52,560 --> 01:28:53,560
when you're being bullied

3087
01:28:53,560 --> 01:28:54,440
or dealing with other things,

3088
01:28:54,440 --> 01:28:55,920
you may feel like

3089
01:28:55,920 --> 01:28:57,920
you've lost control.

3090
01:28:57,920 --> 01:28:59,280
But in your inner game,

3091
01:28:59,280 --> 01:29:01,840
always show yourself grace
and acceptance.

3092
01:29:02,080 --> 01:29:02,800
Of course, sometimes

3093
01:29:02,800 --> 01:29:04,080
self-blame is unavoidable.

3094
01:29:04,080 --> 01:29:04,720
But once you notice it,

3095
01:29:04,720 --> 01:29:05,640
don't believe it.

3096
01:29:05,640 --> 01:29:07,880
That self-blame

3097
01:29:07,880 --> 01:29:10,040
is really the key issue.

3098
01:29:10,280 --> 01:29:12,240
One way to describe trauma

3099
01:29:12,240 --> 01:29:15,280
is that your sense of self is damaged.

3100
01:29:15,280 --> 01:29:16,440
And when that happens,

3101
01:29:16,440 --> 01:29:17,800
one major sign

3102
01:29:17,800 --> 01:29:19,000
is feeling out of control.

3103
01:29:19,160 --> 01:29:19,640
So at that point,

3104
01:29:19,640 --> 01:29:21,400
ask yourself what you can do.

3105
01:29:21,400 --> 01:29:23,000
That's really important.

3106
01:29:23,000 --> 01:29:24,960
Sometimes we can take big steps,

3107
01:29:25,400 --> 01:29:27,480
like asking someone for help,

3108
01:29:27,680 --> 01:29:27,920
right?

3109
01:29:27,920 --> 01:29:29,280
Or look into your legal options

3110
01:29:29,280 --> 01:29:30,800
and see what you can do.

3111
01:29:30,800 --> 01:29:33,600
Sometimes it's the little things,

3112
01:29:33,600 --> 01:29:36,240
like keeping your daily routine.

3113
01:29:36,240 --> 01:29:36,640
That's

3114
01:29:36,640 --> 01:29:37,480
also a small way

3115
01:29:37,480 --> 01:29:38,720
to regain

3116
01:29:38,720 --> 01:29:40,240
some self-control.

3117
01:29:40,600 --> 01:29:41,080
So

3118
01:29:41,080 --> 01:29:42,240
trauma includes this:

3119
01:29:42,240 --> 01:29:43,560
your sense of self gets damaged,

3120
01:29:43,720 --> 01:29:44,800
which makes you feel out of control.

3121
01:29:44,800 --> 01:29:45,200
So at that point,

3122
01:29:45,200 --> 01:29:47,200
regaining some control really matters.

3123
01:29:47,200 --> 01:29:48,680
Another important point

3124
01:29:48,680 --> 01:29:49,240
is what I call

3125
01:29:49,240 --> 01:29:50,440
the "double container".

3126
01:29:50,440 --> 01:29:52,240
Your own self is one container.

3127
01:29:52,880 --> 01:29:54,480
Strong social support

3128
01:29:54,480 --> 01:29:55,560
is another.

3129
01:29:56,280 --> 01:29:58,120
So when trauma happens,

3130
01:29:58,120 --> 01:29:58,640
it means

3131
01:29:58,640 --> 01:30:01,080
your inner container gets damaged.

3132
01:30:01,960 --> 01:30:02,960
But once you notice

3133
01:30:02,960 --> 01:30:03,840
that self-blame is there

3134
01:30:03,840 --> 01:30:04,480
and let it go,

3135
01:30:04,480 --> 01:30:05,600
you can develop

3136
01:30:05,600 --> 01:30:06,920
the ability to soothe yourself.

3137
01:30:06,920 --> 01:30:09,240
That helps hold a lot inside.

3138
01:30:09,240 --> 01:30:10,160
But sometimes,

3139
01:30:10,520 --> 01:30:12,120
your own strength isn't enough.

3140
01:30:12,120 --> 01:30:13,440
We're social beings,

3141
01:30:13,440 --> 01:30:15,400
so a support system

3142
01:30:15,400 --> 01:30:16,400
really matters.

3143
01:30:17,000 --> 01:30:17,920
So at times like this,

3144
01:30:17,920 --> 01:30:19,440
you need to seek out

3145
01:30:19,440 --> 01:30:20,480
help from your

3146
01:30:20,480 --> 01:30:21,800
outside support

3147
01:30:21,800 --> 01:30:22,600
system.

3148
01:30:22,960 --> 01:30:23,680
That becomes

3149
01:30:23,680 --> 01:30:25,320
your outer container.

3150
01:30:26,040 --> 01:30:28,200
When both containers work together,

3151
01:30:28,440 --> 01:30:29,200
that's when

3152
01:30:29,200 --> 01:30:30,640
your emotional trauma

3153
01:30:30,640 --> 01:30:31,320
can

3154
01:30:31,440 --> 01:30:33,240
heal much more fully.

3155
01:30:33,360 --> 01:30:34,760
(Ultimate preview)
You have to find this person

3156
01:30:34,760 --> 01:30:35,640
and figure out what they want.

3157
01:30:35,640 --> 01:30:36,880
Only then can you leave the game.

3158
01:30:36,880 --> 01:30:39,120
The search for ESC.

3159
01:30:39,120 --> 01:30:42,360
I want to activate!

3160
01:30:42,360 --> 01:30:44,480
One of you has already been infected.

3161
01:30:44,480 --> 01:30:46,920
ESC has an accomplice now.

3162
01:30:46,920 --> 01:30:49,000
Aren't we one big happy family?

3163
01:30:49,280 --> 01:30:51,200
Why turn on your own?

3164
01:30:51,360 --> 01:30:52,320
Why are they doing this?

3165
01:30:52,320 --> 01:30:53,740
(One thought divides good and evil,
one line divides life and death)

3166
01:30:53,960 --> 01:30:55,120
Several people's medical records.

3167
01:30:55,120 --> 01:30:56,520
We all have some emotional issues.

3168
01:30:56,520 --> 01:30:57,800
Dark Web Vigilante Loading

3169
01:30:57,800 --> 01:30:58,920
isn't a hero at all.

3170
01:30:58,920 --> 01:30:59,680
He's a lunatic.

3171
01:30:59,680 --> 01:31:01,280
So ESC is just pure evil.

3172
01:31:01,520 --> 01:31:02,080
Someone's there!

3173
01:31:03,400 --> 01:31:03,920
Don't touch me!

3174
01:31:03,920 --> 01:31:06,400
What's that noise?

3175
01:31:06,400 --> 01:31:07,440
Where did he come from?

3176
01:31:07,700 --> 01:31:09,580
(You may know the face,
but never the heart)

3177
01:31:09,680 --> 01:31:11,120
Attention, all patients.

3178
01:31:11,480 --> 01:31:12,920
The assessment is about to begin.

3179
01:31:13,280 --> 01:31:14,240
How are we supposed to hide?

3180
01:31:14,240 --> 01:31:16,080
The bad guys are making their move.

3181
01:31:16,080 --> 01:31:17,000
Come crush me! Come on!

3182
01:31:17,000 --> 01:31:18,320
I need to lie on top of you guys!

3183
01:31:18,760 --> 01:31:19,440
I can't breathe.

3184
01:31:19,440 --> 01:31:20,240
Hang on.

3185
01:31:20,400 --> 01:31:20,600
Okay.

3186
01:31:20,600 --> 01:31:22,480
You two went totally crazy.

3187
01:31:22,640 --> 01:31:24,080
We're completely innocent.

3188
01:31:24,080 --> 01:31:25,120
We had no other choice.

3189
01:31:25,120 --> 01:31:26,760
I think those two
are the most suspicious.

3190
01:31:26,760 --> 01:31:28,000
This is our secret base.

3191
01:31:28,400 --> 01:31:30,840
Every friend has to pass
a compatibility test.

3192
01:31:30,840 --> 01:31:31,960
This is never going to work.

3193
01:31:31,960 --> 01:31:32,760
Be yourself.

3194
01:31:33,320 --> 01:31:34,440
I'm not making a heart for you.

3195
01:31:34,440 --> 01:31:35,920
Why should I make a heart for you?

3196
01:31:36,120 --> 01:31:36,920
Like this.

3197
01:31:37,080 --> 01:31:37,880
A cheek heart.

3198
01:31:38,000 --> 01:31:39,480
Okay, get out.

3199
01:31:39,480 --> 01:31:41,240
Wait, I thought we got it right.

3200
01:31:41,560 --> 01:31:42,600
Someone's messing with us.

3201
01:31:42,600 --> 01:31:43,680
ESC is so evil.

3202
01:31:43,680 --> 01:31:45,540
(A critical moment, danger closing in)

3203
01:31:45,760 --> 01:31:47,960
The only way to activate
the door to reality

3204
01:31:48,200 --> 01:31:49,040
is to test three people.

3205
01:31:49,040 --> 01:31:50,360
Remember, you only get one chance.

3206
01:31:50,360 --> 01:31:52,160
Who wants to step up?

3207
