You're the absolute worst!

3217
01:32:03,400 --> 01:32:04,320
Keep doubting.

3218
01:32:04,400 --> 01:32:05,640
Go ahead. Keep doubting.

3219
01:32:05,640 --> 01:32:06,640
My heart's racing.

3220
